        554.2371826171875
      ],
      "text": "Background HIV and tuberculosis drug resistance prevalence:  Settings with high HIV prevalence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.988544464111328,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.9942016601562,
        527.4464111328125,
        567.4371948242188
      ],
      "text": "are defined as those in which the HIV prevalence is 1% or higher among adult pregnant women, or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        566.1942138671875,
        527.4603881835938,
        580.63720703125
      ],
      "text": "5% or higher among people with TB. WHO does not intend to establish thresholds for low, moderate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
