      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        579.3942260742188,
        527.3992919921875,
        593.8372192382812
      ],
      "text": "or high levels of prevalence of isoniazid resistance. National TB programmes will establish definitions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
